              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse haddii nin duurka ka helo gabadh nin u doonan, oo uu ninku gabadhaas xoogo oo la jiifsado, markaas ninka iyada la jiifsaday keliyahu waa inuu dhintaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse gabadha waxba ha yeelin, maxaa yeelay, gabadha dembi dhimasho istaahilaa kuma jiro, waayo, xaalkanu wuxuu la mid yahay markii nin deriskiisa ku kaco oo dilo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waayo, iyada wuxuu ka helay duurka, oo gabadha ninka u doonanuna way qaylisay oo cid iyada badbaadisana la ma arag.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
